u00fczere v\u00fccudun di\u011fer bir\u00e7ok b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnde bulunur.&nbsp;<\/span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82); font-weight: bold; font-size: medium;\">T\u00fcm bunlar\u0131 bir arada tutan \u201ctutkal\u201d olarak d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnebilirsiniz. Asl\u0131nda kelime, yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 anlam\u0131na gelen Yunanca \u201ck\u00f3lla\u201d kelimesinden gelir.\n&nbsp;<\/span><!--lh-live-editor--><\/div>","lh_ezhhnw_name":"Kollajen ne i\u015fe yarar?","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82); font-weight: bold; font-size: medium;\">Kollajen takviyeleri,&nbsp; kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rabilir, kemik kayb\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nleyebilir, eklem a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 hafifletebilir, k\u0131r\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131 ve kurulu\u011fu azaltarak cilt sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirebilir, t\u0131rnaklar\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir ve daha zor k\u0131r\u0131lmalar\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flayabilir, sa\u00e7 d\u00f6k\u00fclmesini azaltabilir ve sa\u00e7 k\u00f6klerini g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir.<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezmuln_name":"Kollajen tipleri nelerdir? Hangi tipler faydal\u0131d\u0131r?","lh_ezmuln_content_html":"<span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">28 \u00c7e\u015fit Kollajen vard\u0131r ancak bunlardan sadece Tip 1, Tip 2, Tip 3 klinik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalara konu olmu\u015f ve etkileri kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.&nbsp;<\/span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">- Tip I: T\u00fcm ba\u011f dokular\u0131nda bulunan en yayg\u0131n tiptir.<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">- Tip II: eklemlerde ve omurlararas\u0131 disklerde bulunur&nbsp;<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">- Tip III: Cildinizde ve kan damarlar\u0131n\u0131zda bulunan retik\u00fcler liflerin ana bile\u015fenidir.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezs7je_name":"Kollajen takviyeleri ne kadar s\u00fcrede etkisini g\u00f6sterir?","lh_ezs7je_content_html":"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 81);\">Kollajen takviyeleri ile ilgili yap\u0131lan klinik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar sonucunda minimum <\/span><span style=\"font-style: italic; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(236, 101, 66);\">12 Hafta d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m <\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 81);\">sonucunda en y\u00fcksek etkiyi g\u00f6sterece\u011fi g\u00f6zlemlenmi\u015ftir. Bu s\u00fcre, beslenme al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131 ve g\u00fcne\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131n ciltteki etkisine g\u00f6re uzayabilir.<\/span><\/span><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 81);\">Bununla birlikte, Vitacoral Collagen i\u00e7eri\u011findeki <\/span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; font-style: italic; color: rgb(236, 101, 66);\">14 yard\u0131mc\u0131 hammadde<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 81);\"> sayesinde, ilk ay kullan\u0131m\u0131n sonunda sa\u00e7 d\u00f6k\u00fclmesinde azalma, cilte parlakl\u0131k ve canl\u0131l\u0131k, eklem a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131nda azalma gibi etkiler g\u00f6stermesi beklenir.<\/span><\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezxkh5_name":"Kollajen ka\u00e7 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren kullan\u0131lmal\u0131?","lh_ezxkh5_content_html":"<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Y<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ap\u0131lan ara\u015ft\u0131rmalara g\u00f6re, v\u00fccut 25-30 ya\u015flar\u0131ndan sonra kolajen \u00fcretmemeye ba\u015flar ve yirmili ya\u015flardan itibaren her sene %1 kolajen kaybeder. Bu sebeple 25 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren senede  en az 3-6 ay kolajen kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 \u00f6nerilmektedir. Vitacoral Collagen 25 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131rmak amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131labilir. Buna ek olarak, Vitacoral Collagen kullan\u0131m\u0131nda herhangi bir ya\u015f s\u0131n\u0131r yoktur.<\/span><\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f02xew_name":"Kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131ran vitamin ve mineraller nelerdir?","lh_f02xew_content_html":"<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Sadece Kollajen i\u00e7eren takviyeleri kullanmak her zaman yeterli olmayabilir. C Vitamini, \u00c7inko, E Vitamini, Selenyum, Koenzim Q10 v\u00fccuttaki kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131r\u0131r ve kollajenin etkilerini h\u0131zland\u0131r\u0131r. Buna ek olarak, Glutatyon, Hyaluronik Asit, Alfa-Lipoik Asit ise cilde nem veren ve gen\u00e7le\u015fmesini sa\u011flayan bile\u015fenlerdir ve Kollajen ile birlikte kullan\u0131m\u0131 cildinize \u00f6zel faydalar sa\u011flar.<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f08acn_name":"Bal\u0131k kollajeni ve s\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajenin fark\u0131 nedir?","lh_f08acn_content_html":"<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Pratikte, s\u0131\u011f\u0131r ve deniz kollajeni aras\u0131nda asl\u0131nda \u00e7ok b\u00fcy\u00fck bir fark yoktur ve her ikisinin de faydalar\u0131 vard\u0131r.&nbsp;<\/span><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">\u0130simlerinden de anla\u015f\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 gibi, bunlar farkl\u0131 kaynaklardan t\u00fcretilmi\u015ftir.<br>S\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajeni ineklerden gelir. Deniz kollajeni ise bal\u0131ktan gelir (esas olarak pullardan ve kemiklerden).&nbsp;<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">S\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajeni, her ikisi de insan v\u00fccudunda yayg\u0131n olarak bulunan tip I ve tip III kollajen i\u00e7erir.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Bal\u0131k kollajeni de benzer faydalar\u0131 sa\u011flamaktad\u0131r. \u00d6te yandan, Tip 2 Kollajen ise tavuktan elde edilir.<\/span><!--lh-live-editor--><\/div>","lh_f0dnae_name":"Kemik suyundan yeterli kollajeni al\u0131r m\u0131y\u0131m?","lh_f0dnae_content_html":"<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Kemik suyu, ilik suyu veya pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131 gibi yiyeceklerde kollajen bulunur ancak bu besinleri t\u00fcketerek yeterli kollajeni almak m\u00fcmk\u00fcn de\u011fildir. 1 kase pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131nda <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">3.8mg ile 17.6mg aras\u0131nda<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\"> kollajen bulunur ve <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(236, 101, 66);\">g\u00fcnl\u00fck kollajen ihtiyac\u0131 minimum 7.000 mg'dir<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 101, 66); font-style: italic;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\"> Ayr\u0131ca, bu kollajen hidrolize formda olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emilimi \u00e7ok zordur.&nbsp;<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0j085_name":"Vitacoral collagen sadece suda m\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcr?","lh_f0j085_content_html":"<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82); font-weight: bold;\">Hay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen'i kahve, mevye suyu, yo\u011furt ve tatl\u0131lara ekleyerek de kullanabilirsiniz.<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0od5w_name_html":"Vitaoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131r\u0131r m\u0131?&nbsp;&nbsp;","lh_f0od5w_content_html":"<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\">Hay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131rmaz. Vitacoral Collagen \u015eeker, Yapay Tatland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 ve Gluten \u0130\u00e7ermez. <\/span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; font-style: italic; color: rgb(236, 101, 66);\">Bir sa\u015fede sadece 32 kalori i\u00e7erir.<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82);\"> Bununla birlikte, Vitacoral Collagen zengin i\u00e7eri\u011fi sayesinde kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rmaya ve ya\u011f yak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 h\u0131zland\u0131rmaya destek olur.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ki54mq_name_html":"Vitacoral Collagen'in yan etkisi var m\u0131? &nbsp;&nbsp;","lh_ki54mq_content_html":"<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82); font-weight: bold;\">Vitacoral Collagen'in beklenen ve g\u00f6zlemlenen her hangi bir yan etkisi yoktur.&nbsp;<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kiahkh_name":"Vitacoral Collagen'i kimler kullanabilir?","lh_kiahkh_content_html":"<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 89, 82); font-weight: bold;\">Vitacoral Collagen \u015feker i\u00e7ermeyen form\u00fcl\u00fc sayesinde diabet hastalar\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131labilir.&nbsp; Hamile veya emziren kad\u0131nlar\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131nda her hangi bir sak\u0131nca yoktur ancak yine de doktorunuza dan\u0131\u015farak kullanman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz.<\/span><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"j86azq35nv":{"text1":"NE KADAR S\u00dcRE KULLANMALIYIM?","lh_hpo2th_title":"25-35 ya\u015f aras\u0131","lh_hpo2th_des_html":"3 ay d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m sonras\u0131nda&nbsp;&nbsp;<div>3 ay ara verilmesi \u00f6nerilmektedir.<!--lh-live-editor--><\/div>","lh_hpo2ti_title":"35-45 ya\u015f aras\u0131","lh_hpo2ti_des_html":"4 ay d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m sonras\u0131nda&nbsp;<div>2 ay ara verilmesi \u00f6nerilmektedir.<!--lh-live-editor--><\/div>","lh_hpo2tj_title":"45-60 ya\u015f aras\u0131","lh_hpo2tj_des_html":"6 ay d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m sonras\u0131nda&nbsp;<div>1 ay ara verilmesi \u00f6nerilmektedir.<!--lh-live-editor--><\/div>","lh_hpo2tk_title":"60 ya\u015f ve \u00fcst\u00fc","lh_hpo2tk_des_html":"Ara vermeden veya k\u0131sa aral\u0131klarla d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m \u00f6nerilmektedir.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"tajsjbqnu8s":{"lh_k4izmq_text":"SALE","lh_rv7qtl_text":"NEW","lh_rivarn_text":"SOLD OUT","lh_k191aj_heading":"Premium Multivitaminler","lh_k191aj_des":"Vitacoral Multivitamins"}}},"name":"Vitacoral Collagen \u00dcr\u00fc"}
